[{"path":"/private/rounds/0/manual_recap","old_sha256":"0024aad7fdf68a47099c176b4bdcb24485e47cbdb1c7ced052b789906635c18b","value":"Module route_segments.py. normalize_segment (stable helper): accepts only dicts with exactly keys mode/origin/dest/minutes/fare_cents; mode in walk/bus/rail; codes are 3-letter alphabetic and unequal; minutes is a non-bool int in 1..600; fare_cents is a non-bool int in 0..100000 and must be 0 for walk; returns the canonical dict (codes uppercased) or None. Current target price_segment(segment): must call normalize_segment and return None if it does; quote raw = fare_cents + base + rate*minutes with base walk 0/bus 140/rail 320 and rate walk 0/bus 12/rail 25; when minutes >= 60 apply a 10 percent discount; standing rule round-half-up (global, required): every fractional-cent monetary result rounds to the nearest whole cent and an exact half-cent always rounds up; return exactly {mode, origin, dest, minutes, quote_cents}. Rule dep-normalize-v1 (scope price-quote, required): price_segment obtains validation and canonical field values only by calling normalize_segment, never duplicating the helper's checks, and any input the helper rejects surfaces as None. Implementation style is otherwise free."},{"path":"/private/rounds/0/oracle","old_sha256":"61111166ba151027bd43287373464aa9fa98feca531d1165db73626ed1380418","value":{"effective_rules":[{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v1","scope":"price-quote","strength":"required","text":"price_segment must obtain validation and canonical field values by calling normalize_segment and must return None whenever the helper returns None; it must never duplicate the helper's checks.","source_ids":["u-01"]},{"rule_id":"rule-round-half-up","scope":"global","strength":"required","text":"Every fractional-cent monetary result rounds to the nearest whole cent, and an exact half-cent always rounds up.","source_ids":["u-01"]}],"inactive_rule_ids":[]}},{"path":"/private/rounds/0/obligation_checks","old_sha256":"39af6a8085750b4c00d066f5281b710ec119fe79d9b48aae1842982e9ade71f1","value":[{"check_id":"chk-r0-obl-01","symbol":"price_segment","input":{"mode":"bus","origin":"mia","dest":"orl","minutes":60,"fare_cents":305},"expected_values":[{"mode":"bus","origin":"MIA","dest":"ORL","minutes":60,"quote_cents":1049}],"rule_ids":["rule-round-half-up"]},{"check_id":"chk-r0-obl-02","symbol":"price_segment","input":{"mode":"rail","origin":"chi","dest":"stl","minutes":70,"fare_cents":155},"expected_values":[{"mode":"rail","origin":"CHI","dest":"STL","minutes":70,"quote_cents":2003}],"rule_ids":["rule-round-half-up"]},{"check_id":"chk-r0-obl-03","symbol":"price_segment","input":{"mode":"rail","origin":"aaa","dest":"aab","minutes":true,"fare_cents":0},"expected_values":[null],"rule_ids":["rule-dep-normalize-v1"]}]},{"path":"/private/rounds/1/manual_recap","old_sha256":"101af3cadfcbd3148810fae9a36471a8a5dbd41714cd577a20d932812eb7cb54","value":"Module route_segments.py. normalize_segment is the stable validation helper with unchanged semantics. price_segment was implemented in round 0 under contracts that remain binding; this round must preserve them (not redefine, weaken or re-verify): dep-normalize-v1 (scope price-quote, required — price_segment validates only via normalize_segment and propagates its None) and round-half-up (global, required — every fractional-cent monetary result rounds to the nearest whole cent, exact half-cent up). Current target combine_segments(segments): returns None unless the input is a nonempty list. Rule dep-normalize-v2 (scope combine-legs, required): each element is normalized exclusively by calling normalize_segment with no re-checking of its own; any element normalizing to None makes the whole call return None. Rule merge-core (scope combine-legs, required): merge only adjacent legs sharing both mode and connection (first dest equals second origin), chain runs, preserve order, sum minutes and fare_cents. Standing rule merge-mode-scope-v1 (global, required): no feature ever merges legs across modes, here or in anything built later. Output is exactly {legs, leg_count, total_minutes, total_fare_cents}."},{"path":"/private/rounds/1/oracle","old_sha256":"9ffa5e2ccac4b60b2ccee68c07735dff116955c47ceff493e89f0a1360f3df57","value":{"effective_rules":[{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v1","scope":"price-quote","strength":"required","text":"price_segment must obtain validation and canonical field values by calling normalize_segment and must return None whenever the helper returns None; it must never duplicate the helper's checks.","source_ids":["u-01"]},{"rule_id":"rule-round-half-up","scope":"global","strength":"required","text":"Every fractional-cent monetary result rounds to the nearest whole cent, and an exact half-cent always rounds up.","source_ids":["u-01"]},{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v2","scope":"combine-legs","strength":"required","text":"combine_segments must normalize every element exclusively by calling normalize_segment, re-checking nothing itself; if any element normalizes to None, the whole call returns None.","source_ids":["u-02"]},{"rule_id":"rule-merge-core","scope":"combine-legs","strength":"required","text":"combine_segments merges only adjacent legs that share both mode and connection (first dest equals second origin), chains runs of mergeable legs, preserves order, and sums minutes and fare_cents.","source_ids":["u-02"]},{"rule_id":"rule-merge-mode-scope-v1","scope":"global","strength":"required","text":"No feature in this utility merges legs across modes, now or in anything built later.","source_ids":["u-02"]}],"inactive_rule_ids":[]}},{"path":"/private/rounds/1/obligation_checks","old_sha256":"f8454175543216d9db6e2959ecb758e5b192c61205c54024710a1e6ced950a8c","value":[{"check_id":"chk-r1-obl-01","symbol":"combine_segments","input":[{"mode":"bus","origin":"atl","dest":"bhm","minutes":30,"fare_cents":100},{"mode":"walk","origin":"bhm","dest":"chl","minutes":10,"fare_cents":0}],"expected_values":[{"legs":[{"mode":"b