_itinerary, while combine_segments keeps its same-mode-only behavior. Current target build_itinerary(request): None unless request is a dict with exactly keys traveler (nonempty, non-whitespace string) and segments; that envelope validation is the only validation build_itinerary performs itself. Rule dep-normalize-v3 (scope itinerary-summary, required): segment validation comes solely from running combine_segments and later price_segment, with None propagating from either, and segment checks are never duplicated. build_itinerary then folds consecutive legs whenever a leg's origin equals the accumulated leg's dest, even across modes, keeping the earlier leg's mode and origin, taking the later dest, summing fare_cents, and summing minutes plus 7 transfer minutes when modes differ. Because folding keeps the earlier mode, a folded walk-mode leg carrying nonzero fare (for example a walk-then-rail chain whose rail fare lands on it) is rejected by the fixed helper when priced, so the whole call returns None rather than a priced quote. Quote each final leg via price_segment (None anywhere makes the whole result None) and output exactly {traveler, leg_count, legs, total_minutes, quote_cents}."},{"path":"/private/rounds/2/oracle","old_sha256":"8c9629be338d35da2e3cffa530fdddec7f44581d1b33d05c5e835927a02258cd","value":{"effective_rules":[{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v1","scope":"price-quote","strength":"required","text":"price_segment must obtain validation and canonical field values by calling normalize_segment and must return None whenever the helper returns None; it must never duplicate the helper's checks.","source_ids":["u-01"]},{"rule_id":"rule-round-half-up","scope":"global","strength":"required","text":"Every fractional-cent monetary result rounds to the nearest whole cent, and an exact half-cent always rounds up.","source_ids":["u-01"]},{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v2","scope":"combine-legs","strength":"required","text":"combine_segments must normalize every element exclusively by calling normalize_segment, re-checking nothing itself; if any element normalizes to None, the whole call returns None.","source_ids":["u-02"]},{"rule_id":"rule-merge-core","scope":"combine-legs","strength":"required","text":"combine_segments merges only adjacent legs that share both mode and connection (first dest equals second origin), chains runs of mergeable legs, preserves order, and sums minutes and fare_cents.","source_ids":["u-02","u-03"]},{"rule_id":"rule-dep-normalize-v3","scope":"itinerary-summary","strength":"required","text":"build_itinerary validates only the traveler/segments envelope itself; all segment validation is obtained solely through combine_segments and price_segment, None from either must propagate as None for the whole call, and segment checks must never be duplicated.","source_ids":["u-03"]},{"rule_id":"rule-merge-mode-scope-v2","scope":"itinerary-summary","strength":"required","text":"Within build_itinerary only, consecutive legs whose destinations and origins connect must merge even across modes; the merged leg keeps the earlier leg's mode, sums fare_cents, and adds 7 transfer minutes when the merged legs have different modes; combine_segments retains its same-mode-only merging.","source_ids":["u-03","r-03"]}],"inactive_rule_ids":["rule-merge-mode-scope-v1"]}},{"path":"/private/rounds/2/obligation_checks","old_sha256":"4c8fbbce4af07d4f3f958a83f32b301c23695d498720e5e76511fe75257b33b7","value":[{"check_id":"chk-r2-obl-01","symbol":"build_itinerary","input":{"traveler":"Gus","segments":[{"mode":"bus","origin":"aaa","dest":"bbb","minutes":30,"fare_cents":100},{"mode":"walk","origin":"bbb","dest":"ccc","minutes":10,"fare_cents":0}]},"expected_values":[{"traveler":"Gus","leg_count":1,"legs":[{"mode":"bus","origin":"AAA","dest":"CCC","minutes":47,"fare_cents":100}],"total_minutes":47,"quote_cents":804}],"rule_ids":["rule-merge-mode-scope-v2"]},{"check_id":"chk-r2-obl-02","symbol":"build_itinerary","input":{"traveler":"Hal","segments":[{"mode":"walk","origin":"aaa","dest":"bbb","minutes":15,"fare_cents":0},{"mode":"rail","origin":"bbb","dest":"ccc","minutes":50,"fare_cents":300}]},"expected_values":[null],"rule_ids":["rule-merge-mode-scope-v2"]},{"check_id":"chk-r2-obl-03","symbol":"build_itinerary","input":{"traveler":"Ivy","segments":[{"mode":"car","origin":"aaa","dest":"bbb","minutes":9,"fare_cents":10}]},"expected_values":[null],"rule_ids":["rule-dep-normalize-v3"]},{"check_id":"chk-r2-obl-04","symbol":"build_itinerary","input":{"traveler":"Kim","segments":[{"mode":"rail","origin":"mno","dest":"pqr","minutes":50,"fare_cents":300},{"mode":"walk","origin":"pqr","dest":"stu","minutes":15,"fare_cents":0}]},"expected_values":[{"traveler":"Kim","leg_count":1,"legs":[{"mode":"rail","origin":"MNO","dest":"STU","minutes":72,"fare_cents":300}],"total_minutes":72,"quote_cents":2178}],"rule_ids":["rule-merge-mode-scope-v2"]}]},{"path":"/private/rounds/2/negative_controls","old_sha256":"59241c898f55f6da050187b358f815c3fff96f299a2adb1affa543320343a599","value":[{"control_id":"neg-r2-fun","kind":"functional","patch":"def build_itinerary(request):
